#* {{quote-book|en|year=2021| title=The Imperial Stars|author=Edward Elmer Smith | page=| passage=Hair down to my shoulders; waved and liquid-golded. Eyebrows shaved to a different shape and '''golded'''. Handle-bar mustache, waxed to points and '''golded'''. }}

