===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|ceb|en|gold}}, from {{der|ceb|enm|gold}}, from {{der|ceb|ang|gold||gold}}, from {{der|ceb|gem-pro|*gulþą||gold}}, from {{der|ceb|ine-pro|*ǵʰl̥tóm||gold}}, from {{der|ceb|ine-pro|*ǵʰelh₃-||yellow; gleam; to shine}}.

===Noun===
{{head|ceb|noun}}

# {{l|ceb|gold}} (chemical element)
# a coin or coinage made of this material, or supposedly so
# a bright yellow color, resembling the metal gold
# a [[gold medal]]
# {{lb|ceb|fantasy|_|RPG|fantasy|_|board games}} miscellaneous unit of currency in fantasy genre

===Adjective===
{{head|ceb|adjective}}

# having the colour of {{l|ceb|gold}}

===Quotations===
{{seeCites|ceb}}

{{C|ceb|Metals|Yellows}}

