==Danish==

===Etymology===
Probably from or related to {{der|da|non|geldr|t=barren, yielding no milk}}, from {{der|da|gem-pro|*galdaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*galdijaz|t=barren, unfruitful}}, from {{der|da|ine-pro|*gʰel-|t=to shout, cry}}.

See also {{cog|sv|gall|t=barren}}, {{cog|de|galt}}, {{m|de|gelt|t=yielding no milk, unfruitful}}, {{cog|non|gelda|t=to castrate}}.

